<title>jamaica: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULT/SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULT/SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>DISCOVERY BAY, Jamaica 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result and close of play scores on the third day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Saturday.</p>
<p>In Discovery Bay: Windward Islands 117 and 161 (Courtney Walsh 5-49, Franklyn Rose 3-42), Jamaica 276 and 4-0. Jamaica won by 10 wickets.</p>
<p>In Basseterre, St Kitts: Barbados 275 and 165-7 (Roland Holder 57), Leeward Islands 152 (Hendy Bryan 5-39).</p>
